# ==========================================================
# CELL 12.c.2 — Clean-slate non-A1 IoT continuous VAL candidates
# v8.14-THESIS V16/V4/V7 candidate expansion / STUDY-THESIS strict, contract-locked
# ==========================================================
# Purpose
#   Build VAL-sized candidate columns for every eligible non-A1 generator.
#   Fit every candidate on TRAIN only.
#   Use VAL only for observed-mask evaluation and candidate scoring.
#   Do not materialize TEST length.
#   Do not select winners; Cell 12.c.3 owns selection.
#   Do not use historical blocker lists, target bridges, manual repairs, or
#   downstream QA-derived column names.
#
# Required previous-cell globals
#   CFG, log, df_tr, df_val, OUTDIR, OUT_SYN, REPORT_DIR, SEED,
#   CONT_VALUE_COLS, FAMILY_MAP, SYNTHESIS_SUBFAMILY_MAP,
#   IOT_VALUE_PORTFOLIO_ELIGIBILITY_DF
#
# Main outputs
#   synthetic/IOT_SPECIALIZED_CANDIDATES_VAL.parquet
#   synthetic/IOT_STATISTICAL_CANDIDATES_VAL.parquet
#   synthetic/IOT_SEQUENCE_CANDIDATES_VAL.parquet
#   synthetic/IOT_VAL_CANDIDATES_ALL.parquet
#   reports/cell12c2_all_val_candidate_metrics.csv
#   reports/cell12c2_val_candidate_audit_all.csv
#   reports/cell12c2_val_candidate_inventory.csv
#   reports/cell12c2_candidate_portfolio_coverage.csv
#   reports/cell12c2_sequence_fit_summary.csv
#   artifacts/cell12c2_val_candidate_manifest.json
# ==========================================================

